message: "If you use this software, or data parsed with it, please cite it as below."
title: dexamine
abstract: >-
  dexamine is a Python package that parses Uniswap v2 and Uniswap v3 events (swap,
  mint and burn) from Ethereum transaction receipt logs. Given a transaction position
  (block number and transaction index), it fetches the transaction, receipt and block
  from any Ethereum JSON-RPC endpoint, decodes the Uniswap events, and returns
  normalized records that join the economic content of each event with the execution
  metadata of the transaction that produced it.
